    "SOURCE_COORDINATE_DRAFT: manually measured from immutable original; approximately 2-5 px uncertainty at soft silhouette edges. Source points require visual review after deformation; they are not an approved final registration.",
    "One continuous garment polygon includes both concave arm/body gaps and the true open-neck edge.",
