    "Source contour review: original source colour boundaries measured, largest continuous garment region retained, one source-pixel inset used to avoid mixed background/skin edge pixels. No source raster changed. Source anatomical armpit and collar-tip landmarks retained; boundary landmarks adjusted to reviewed vector edge.",
